Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: crashlog
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/intel/crashlog/issues
Source: https://github.com/intel/crashlog
Comment:
 The stanzas covering vendor/* describe the Rust crates that are bundled in the
 vendor component of the upstream tarball. They have to be checked, and updated
 if needed, whenever the dependency tree changes:
 `packaging/vendor-licenses.sh -f dep5` regenerates them from the vendored tree.

